---
description: Gate scripts, git hooks, and xtask
globs: scripts/**,kuro-rs/xtask/**,.githooks/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Scripts are thin wrappers over `cargo xtask` and documented PowerShell stages.
Never `Stop-Process` or restart a running Kuro instance from checks.
Never write outside the repo or a temp directory in gate logic.
Protected path list lives in `kuro-rs/xtask/data/`; edit only with ADR 0018.
`Test-KuroGate.ps1` and `Test-KuroInvariants.ps1` are PROTECTED.
Prefer adding checks to `xtask` over duplicating logic in bash-only tools.
Hooks call `gate fast` on commit and `gate full` on push; keep them fast.